# Same bytes on every OS: Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true by default in Git for Windows and on GitHub's
# Windows runners) must not turn scripts and manifests into CRLF (bash chokes on `\r`, helm/yq values grow a `\r`).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.tpl text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.lock text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.tgz binary
